DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The mmccxx driver supports Mellanox 5th generation Ethernet devices.
     Chipsets and cards in this group include:

           ••   ConnectX-4 Lx EN
           ••   ConnectX-4 EN
           ••   ConnectX-5 EN
           ••   ConnectX-6 EN
           ••   ConnectX-6 Dx EN
           ••   ConnectX-6 Lx EN

     It supports SR-IOV virtual functions as well as physical functions.

